- Run individual tests in headless mode with `scripts/runSpecHeadless.sh` , for example `scripts/runSpecHeadless.sh test/specs/entries/entriesContextMenu/hasAWorkingEditor.spec.ts`.
- After making changes to integration tests, make sure `pnpm run unit` also passes (these are `vitest` tests).
- The entire test suide can be run with `pnpm ci-headless`.
